{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2021-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1640304000, "end_date": 1640995199, "month_true_total": 1940, "quota": 18, "returned": 18, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:48:23 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "107018385", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062139262", "personaname": "蜥蜴脑", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198062139262/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 2716, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2077, "last_played": 1655689626, "avatar": "950f9f3147d4c8530a5072825d01c34ee3f1afa1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you like Left 4 Dead? \nDo you like rpg and unique character mechanics?\nAre you fond of cards?\n\nIf so, then B4B is a great evolution of the ideas of Left 4 Dead and is a definite pickup.", "timestamp_created": 1640995054, "timestamp_updated": 1640995054, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.438729196786880493", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107018384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035702326", "personaname": "Trash_Master", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lazyhackfraud/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 90, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 90, "last_played": 1637907390, "avatar": "8a363bc13dfb10d71a975b13654f8ebd8e1c1a28"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a very standard horde shooter game. It doesn't really bring anything new to the table. The perk system is based on RNG, where you make a deck of \"cards\" with various bonuses on them, and you draw some every game. The problem is you don't get to choose your perks so any semblance of strategy is lost. Along with this the difficulty from normal to hard is way too steep. It goes from too easy, to way too hard with a single setting change. There are so many better co-op shooter choices for your money, like Payday 2, Left 4 Dead, and Vermintide 2. Boring, slow, and a very poorly balanced difficulty system. Not worth the price tag at all.", "timestamp_created": 1640995052, "timestamp_updated": 1640995052, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48256838321685791", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107015727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090919357", "personaname": "TechFox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090919357/", "num_games_owned": 334, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 5701, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1540, "last_played": 1688242672, "avatar": "209df01d6dcdf15d1427227334293a52af65e811"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nightmare mode brings out the gaming addict in me", "timestamp_created": 1640991859, "timestamp_updated": 1640991859, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107014955", "author": {"steamid": "76561199072422963", "personaname": "VeriEri", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199072422963/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4066, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2483, "last_played": 1651382481, "avatar": "8cf7937574b6c2b78bac047b735d20