 \"4\" joke and random tencent complaint here.", "timestamp_created": 1640980014, "timestamp_updated": 1642183768, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497448980808258057", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107002685", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083703042", "personaname": "AcornJ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AcornJ/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1247, "last_played": 1640817260, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "Back 4 Blood\n\nWait 4 Sale", "timestamp_created": 1640977194, "timestamp_updated": 1640977194, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.460526347160339355", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107001620", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969870192", "personaname": "RamenEater", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969870192/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 11062, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 742, "last_played": 1644903434, "avatar": "b19f419fc2a688e6e9cfead44fe34bfee1918571"}, "language": "english", "review": "Technical issues with the game cause my PC to restart with BSOD/Stop Code at regular intervals. Have to verify the files after each restart to get the game to start again. A big reason for the negative review. \n\nDropping into a quickplay game does not allow you to pick a character or cards to use. This can be a boon if the bot is using some particularly powerful cards. Most of the time its a bust. If you complete the mission, the next mission will allow you to pick a character and deck, but you start out with the bot's loadout instead of your chosen character's default loadout. \n\nThe in-game callouts (pings) are ok. The wheel is a bit to finicky for me and it's next to the bash button by default. The quick ping is vital against specials since they are highlighted with an outline.\n\nIn-game inventory management is mess. You can drop weapons, money (copper), and ammo on the ground, but it's done thru a large screen covering menu. You can only drop weapon attachments by buying new ones or picking up ones found in the mission. \n\nDeck management is vital and the grind is real. Active cards are split into 3 supply lines and take roughly 200-500 supply points to complete. Problem is that supply runs also include cosmetics such as sprays, clothes, and weapon skins. This slows down the deck creation process. I wouldn't have minded a separate supply lines for cosmetics similar to what they are now doing for roving merchants. \n\nThe director AI is just as cruel as the game that it takes its inspiration from. Be prepared for additional corruption cards to drop in if you are doing just a bit too well.", "timestamp_created": 1640976136, "timestamp_updated": 1640976136, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "106997741", "author": {"steamid": "76561198277966912", "personaname": "Stephan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198277966912/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 765, 